92 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (Managing and analyzing over 5 million vehicle-related records across multiple operational units presented significant challenges in data accessibility, monitoring, and decision-making. Critical information was distributed across various sources, making trend identification, performance tracking, and reporting processes inefficient. To address these challenges, SIAP-PPKB was developed as a large-scale monitoring and analytics platform consisting of 10+ integrated modules, enabling centralized data management, operational monitoring, arrears analysis, geospatial visualization, and data-driven decision support for multiple business divisions.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [26]
>>
endobj
