94 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (As both a Project Manager and Technical Contributor, this project strengthened my ability to bridge leadership and software engineering responsibilities within a large-scale system. I coordinated development activities, managed project requirements, facilitated communication between stakeholders and developers, and ensured feature quality through structured testing processes. From a technical perspective, I gained hands-on experience in backend architecture, data processing, quality assurance, and designing systems capable of handling millions of records. Most importantly, I learned how to transform complex operational data into actionable insights that support organizational decision-making.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [28]
>>
endobj
